@host = http://localhost:5249


### Public health

GET {{host}}/
Accept: application/json


### Protected fulfillment - no token

POST {{host}}/api/fulfillment/orders/SYN-1001/calculate
Accept: application/json

### Protected fulfillment - invalid token

POST {{host}}/api/fulfillment/orders/SYN-1001/calculate
Authorization: Bearer this-is-not-a-valid-token
Accept: application/json